    <remarks>
      <para>Pass a value of this enumeration to <see cref="M:SkiaSharp.SKImage.RequestReadPixels(SkiaSharp.SKImageInfo,SkiaSharp.SKRectI,SkiaSharp.SKImageRescaleGamma,SkiaSharp.SKImageRescaleMode,System.Action{SkiaSharp.SKImageReadPixelsResult})" /> or <see cref="M:SkiaSharp.SKSurface.RequestReadPixels(SkiaSharp.SKImageInfo,SkiaSharp.SKRectI,SkiaSharp.SKImageRescaleGamma,SkiaSharp.SKImageRescaleMode,System.Action{SkiaSharp.SKImageReadPixelsResult})" /> to control both the quality and the cost of the rescaling step.</para>
    </remarks>
  </Docs>
